      "title": "Almond & Ginseng Cuticle Oil",
      "subtitle": "Our softening cuticle oil is enhanced with a blend of natural almond and ginseng oils which work to moisturize your cuticles and improve the look of your nails. This cuticle oil protects the cuticle and nail against damage to enhance the health and appearance of the nail and is the perfect first step to your manicure! \n\nDirections for use: \n\nStep 1: Apply a small drop of the Almond and Ginseng Cuticle Oil on your bare nails near the cuticle.\n\nStep 2: Massage the cuticle oil into the nail to moisturize and soften the cuticle and promote nail growth.\n\nStep 3: Once the nail and cuticle are softened, wash hands with soap and water. Once dry, apply your favorite 786 Cosmetics nail polish and enjoy your beautiful nails!",
